# Optional private reverse proxy. Public Internet exposure is discouraged.
# Prefer an SSH tunnel: docs/HOSTING.md
#
# If you terminate TLS on this machine:
# - Node stays on 127.0.0.1:8090 (HOST=127.0.0.1)
# - Set HERMES_AGENT_OS_REQUIRE_AUTH=1 and a token that is not in git
# - Set HERMES_AGENT_OS_COOKIE_SECURE=1
# - Leave port 8090 closed on the firewall
# - Do not use this file as a public product site
#
# your-private-name.example {
#   reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8090
# }
